              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 15:55",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzobacungura mbakūre mu bubasha bg’i kuzimu; nzobagōmbōra mbakūre mu rupfu: wa rupfu we, ikīza watera kiri hehe? Wa kuzimu we, kwa guhonnya kwawe kuri hehe? Arik’ ukwihana kwabo guhishijwe inyonga zanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
